LEVEL6 {File Viewer}

WELCOME {<ESC>[0;1;36m
File Viewer v<TV:GALFV_VERSION>
} T Shown when a user enters the library

LISTHDR {<ESC>[0;1;36m
  ##  Document         Title
<ESC>[0;34m ---- ---------------- -----------------------------------------------
} T Document list heading

LISTROW {<ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_NUM:R:4>  <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC:L:16> <ESC>[0;36m<TV:GALFV_TITLE>
} T One row of the document list

LISTROWH {<ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_NUM:R:4>  <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC:L:16> <ESC>[0;36m<TV:GALFV_TITLE> <ESC>[0;35m(hidden)
} T One row of the document list, for a hidden document (sysops only)

LISTNONE {<ESC>[0;36m
  The library is empty.
} T The document list has nothing to show

LISTMORE {<ESC>[0;36m  (Press Enter to see more documents)
} T More documents follow on the next page of the list

LIBPRU {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Document number or name, <ESC>[1;37mL<ESC>[1;36m to list again, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m to exit: } T Library prompt for users

LIBPRA {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Number or name, <ESC>[1;37mA<ESC>[1;36mdd, <ESC>[1;37mE<ESC>[1;36mdit, <ESC>[1;37mD<ESC>[1;36melete, <ESC>[1;37mH<ESC>[1;36meaders, <ESC>[1;37mL<ESC>[1;36mist, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m to exit: } T Library prompt for users who may add documents

LIBPRS {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Number or name, <ESC>[1;37mA<ESC>[1;36mdd, <ESC>[1;37mE<ESC>[1;36mdit, <ESC>[1;37mD<ESC>[1;36melete, <ESC>[1;37mH<ESC>[1;36meaders, <ESC>[1;37mF<ESC>[1;36mile, <ESC>[1;37mS<ESC>[1;36mettings, <ESC>[1;37mL<ESC>[1;36mist, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36mit: } T Library prompt for sysops

LIBHELP {<ESC>[0;35m
Type a document's number or name to view it.  Enter shows the next page
of the list, L lists from the top and X leaves.  Authors can also use
A to add a document, E to change one, D to delete one and H for the
headers shown above documents.  Sysops can use F to view any file on the
server by path and S for the settings.
} T Library help

NODOC {<ESC>[1;31m
There is no document called <TV:GALFV_DOC>.
} T Unknown document name

NOACCESS {<ESC>[1;31m
You do not have access to <TV:GALFV_DOC>.
} T The user lacks the key a document requires

BADNUM {<ESC>[1;31m
That number is not on the list.
} T Document number out of range

NOOPEN {<ESC>[1;31m
Cannot open <TV:GALFV_FILE>.
} T A file could not be opened

CREATEQ {<ESC>[0;1;36m
The document <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC><ESC>[1;36m does not exist yet.  Create it now (<ESC>[1;37mY<ESC>[1;36m/<ESC>[1;37mN<ESC>[1;36m)? } T A menu link names a document that has not been created

RAWASK {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Full path of the server file to view (Enter to cancel): } T Sysop: path of a server file to view

EDWHICH {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Name of the document to change (Enter to cancel): } T Which document to change

DELWHICH {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Name of the document to delete (Enter to cancel): } T Which document to delete

PGCLS {<ESC>[0m<ESC>[2J<ESC>[H} T Clears the screen before each page (ANSI users)

PGSEP {
} T Separates pages for users without ANSI

PGBOTH {<ESC>[0;36m
<ESC>[1;37mN<ESC>[0;36mext <ESC>[1;37mP<ESC>[0;36mrev <ESC>[1;37mT<ESC>[0;36mop <ESC>[1;37mC<ESC>[0;36montinuous <ESC>[1;37mK<ESC>[0;36meyword <ESC>[1;37mB<ESC>[0;36maud <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[0;36mit  Page <TV:GALFV_PAGE> (<TV:GALFV_PCT>%%): } T Page prompt with next and previous pages

PGNEXT {<ESC>[0;36m
<ESC>[1;37mN<ESC>[0;36mext <ESC>[1;37mC<ESC>[0;36montinuous <ESC>[1;37mK<ESC>[0;36meyword <ESC>[1;37mB<ESC>[0;36maud <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[0;36mit  Page <TV:GALFV_PAGE> (<TV:GALFV_PCT>%%): } T Page prompt on the first page

PGPREV {<ESC>[0;36m
End.  <ESC>[1;37mP<ESC>[0;36mrev <ESC>[1;37mT<ESC>[0;36mop <ESC>[1;37mK<ESC>[0;36meyword <ESC>[1;37mB<ESC>[0;36maud <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[0;36mit (or Enter)  Page <TV:GALFV_PAGE>: } T Page prompt on the last page

PGONLY {<ESC>[0;36m
End.  <ESC>[1;37mK<ESC>[0;36meyword <ESC>[1;37mB<ESC>[0;36maud <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[0;36mit (or Enter): } T Page prompt when the document fits on one page

PGHELP {<ESC>[0;35m
N or Enter: next page   P: previous   T: first page   a number: that page
C: continuous from here   K: keyword search   B rate: simulated baud rate
X: exit} T Page prompt help

PGFAR {<ESC>[1;31m
Pages 1 to <TV:GALFV_PAGE> can be shown so far.} T Page number not reached yet

FVWBIG {<ESC>[1;31m
This file has more pages than can be tracked; use C for continuous.} T File too large to page through

KWASK {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Up to 6 keywords, separated by spaces (Enter to cancel): } T Ask for search keywords

KWDIR {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Search <ESC>[1;37mF<ESC>[1;36morward or <ESC>[1;37mB<ESC>[1;36mackward (Enter = forward)? } T Ask for the search direction

KWWAIT {<ESC>[0;36m
Searching... (press Enter to stop)} T A search is running

KWNONE {<ESC>[1;31m
No more matches.} T The search found nothing

KWFOUND {<ESC>[1;32m
Found "<TV:GALFV_WORD>" - press Enter for the next match.} T The search found a match on this page

KABT {<ESC>[1;31m
Search cancelled.} T The search was cancelled

ASKMODE {<ESC>[0;1;36m
<TV:GALFV_TITLE>
View it <ESC>[1;37mP<ESC>[1;36mage by page or <ESC>[1;37mC<ESC>[1;36montinuously (Enter = page by page, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m to exit)? } T Ask how to show a document

FEEDBGN {<ESC>[0;36m
(Continuous display - press Enter to stop)<ESC>[0m
} T Continuous display is starting

FEEDEND {<ESC>[0;36m
End of <TV:GALFV_TITLE>.  Press Enter: } T Continuous display has finished

FEEDSTOP {<ESC>[0;36m
Stopped.
} T Continuous display was stopped

BAUDNOW {<ESC>[0;36m
Simulated speed: <TV:GALFV_BAUD>.  Type B and a rate (300, 1200, 2400... or OFF) to change it.} T Shows the simulated baud rate

BAUDSET {<ESC>[0;36m
Simulated speed is now <TV:GALFV_BAUD>.} T The simulated baud rate was changed

BAUDBAD {<ESC>[1;31m
Rates from 110 to 115200 can be simulated, or OFF for full speed.} T Bad baud rate

ADDNAME {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Name for the new document (2-15 letters, digits, - or _; Enter to cancel): } T Ask for a new document's name

BADNAME {<ESC>[1;31m
Names are 2 to 15 letters, digits, - or _, starting with a letter or digit.} T Bad document name

NAMETAKN {<ESC>[1;31m
There is already a document called <TV:GALFV_DOC>.} T Document name in use

ADDTITLE {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Title for <TV:GALFV_DOC> (Enter to use the name): } T Ask for a new document's title

ADDSRC {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Where does the content come from?
  <ESC>[1;37mU<ESC>[1;36m) Upload a file
  <ESC>[1;37mW<ESC>[1;36m) Write it now with the editor
  <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m) Cancel
Choice: } T Content source menu

ADDSRCS {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Where does the content come from?
  <ESC>[1;37mU<ESC>[1;36m) Upload a file
  <ESC>[1;37mW<ESC>[1;36m) Write it now with the editor
  <ESC>[1;37mL<ESC>[1;36m) Link a file already on the server
  <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m) Cancel
Choice: } T Content source menu for sysops

ADDPATH {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Full path of the server file to link (Enter to cancel): } T Sysop: file to link a document to

ADDCANC {<ESC>[0;36m
Nothing was added.
} T Adding a document was cancelled

UPLDONE {<ESC>[1;32m
The file for <TV:GALFV_DOC> was received.} T Upload succeeded

UPLFAIL {<ESC>[1;31m
No file was received.} T Upload failed or was cancelled

EDTQUIT {<ESC>[0;36m
Nothing was saved.} T The editor was left without saving

EDTWERR {<ESC>[1;31m
Could not write <TV:GALFV_FILE>.} T The written document could not be saved

EDTSAVED {<ESC>[1;32m
<TV:GALFV_DOC> saved.} T The written document was saved

EDTBIG {<ESC>[1;31m
This document is too large (or is a linked server file) to edit online.
Upload a replacement with U instead.} T Document cannot be edited online

DOCHDR {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Document <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC><ESC>[0;36m - added by <TV:GALFV_OWNER> on <TV:GALFV_VALUE>, viewed <TV:GALFV_COUNT> times
<ESC>[0;34m-----------------------------------------------------------------------
} T Heading of a document's property menu

DOCROW {<ESC>[0;36m  (<ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_ITEM><ESC>[0;36m) <TV:GALFV_LABEL:L:24> <ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_VALUE>
} T One property of a document

DOCPRMT {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Number to change, <ESC>[1;37mU<ESC>[1;36mpload new content, <ESC>[1;37mW<ESC>[1;36mrite online, <ESC>[1;37mV<ESC>[1;36miew, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m done: } T Document property menu prompt

DOCVAL {<ESC>[0;36m
<TV:GALFV_LABEL> is now: <ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_VALUE><ESC>[0;36m
Allowed: <TV:GALFV_LIMIT>
New value (Enter keeps it): } T Ask for a new property value

DOCSAVED {<ESC>[1;32m
<TV:GALFV_LABEL> set to: <TV:GALFV_VALUE>} T A property was changed

BADVAL {<ESC>[1;31m
That value is not allowed; nothing was changed.} T Bad property or setting value

NOTYOURS {<ESC>[1;31m
<TV:GALFV_DOC> was added by someone else; only sysops can change it.} T The user may not change this document

DELCONF {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Delete <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC><ESC>[1;36m (<TV:GALFV_TITLE>)?  This cannot be undone (<ESC>[1;37mY<ESC>[1;36m/<ESC>[1;37mN<ESC>[1;36m): } T Confirm deleting a document

DELDONE {<ESC>[1;32m
<TV:GALFV_DOC> deleted.
} T A document was deleted

SETHDR {<ESC>[0;1;36m
File Viewer v<TV:GALFV_VERSION> Settings (changes apply immediately)
<ESC>[0;34m-----------------------------------------------------------------------
} T Heading of the settings page

SETROW {<ESC>[0;36m  (<ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_ITEM:R:2><ESC>[0;36m) <TV:GALFV_LABEL:L:34> <ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_VALUE>
} T One row of the settings page

SETPRMT {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Number to change, <ESC>[1;37mR<ESC>[1;36m to reset all to the defaults, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m to go back: } T Settings page prompt

SETVAL {<ESC>[0;36m
<TV:GALFV_LABEL> is now: <ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_VALUE><ESC>[0;36m
Allowed: <TV:GALFV_LIMIT>
New value (Enter keeps it): } T Ask for a new setting value

SETSAVED {<ESC>[1;32m
<TV:GALFV_LABEL> set to: <TV:GALFV_VALUE>} T A setting was changed

SETRSTQ {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Reset every setting to its default (<ESC>[1;37mY<ESC>[1;36m/<ESC>[1;37mN<ESC>[1;36m)? } T Confirm resetting all settings

SETRSTD {<ESC>[1;32m
All settings were reset to their defaults.} T All settings were reset

HDRLIST {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Headers (a document shows one at its top when its Header setting names it)
<ESC>[0;34m ---------------- ------ ----------------------------------------------
} T Header list heading

HDRROW { <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC:L:16> <ESC>[1;37m<TV:GALFV_VALUE:R:6> <ESC>[0;36m<TV:GALFV_TITLE>
} T One row of the header list: name, height in lines, title

HDRNONE {<ESC>[0;36m
  There are no headers yet.
} T The header list is empty

HDRPRMT {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Header name to change, <ESC>[1;37mA<ESC>[1;36mdd, <ESC>[1;37mD<ESC>[1;36melete, <ESC>[1;37mL<ESC>[1;36mist, <ESC>[1;37mX<ESC>[1;36m to go back: } T Header section prompt

HDRNAME {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Name for the new header (2-15 letters, digits, - or _; Enter to cancel): } T Ask for a new header's name

HDRDELW {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Name of the header to delete (Enter to cancel): } T Which header to delete

HDRMHDR {<ESC>[0;1;36m
Header <ESC>[1;33m<TV:GALFV_DOC><ESC>[0;36m - added by <TV:GALFV_OWNER> on <TV:GALFV_VALUE>
Shown by <TV:GALFV_COUNT> document(s)
<ESC>[0;34m-----------------------------------------------------------------------
} T Heading of a header's property menu

NOHDR {<ESC>[1;31m
There is no header called <TV:GALFV_DOC>.
} T Unknown header name
